    preferences.xml shows them in the section's untitled first group. Every other row of the
    section folds behind its "More … settings (n)" row; search still finds it. Desktop Nightjar
    mirrors this list (MAIN_KEYS, mapped through ANDROID_KEYS), and scripts/generate-settings.py
    writes the Tier column of docs/settings.md from it.
-->
